    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/listening-01.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/listening-01.wav",
      "script": "としょかんへいきます。あねと、ばすでいきます。ぎんこうへはいきません。",
      "sha256": "d3ca9e113626c46409f5d9134f374204dc9dc5fd7d5ccc09fc69f9cf22c5c403",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/listening-02.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/listening-02.wav",
      "script": "えきへいきます。きょうは、でんしゃでいきません。あるいていきます。",
      "sha256": "982cb478e096890adb5e829977277482946034f484d5d41d9e17e8db8808f3e3",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/listening-03.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/listening-03.wav",
      "script": "わたしは、ともだちと、がっこうへいきます。あには、ひとりで、としょかんへいきます。",
      "sha256": "4adee8f3ad8cf0955ef09971b09fe453cc07edb24de0f8409d64ec8e0d9b8c05",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/listening-04.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/listening-04.wav",
      "script": "ははは、びょういんへ、たくしーでいきます。あねは、ぎんこうへ、ばすでいきます。",
      "sha256": "36c9e3b692b1c975eaee1e98653d95d5b6c7e8f79bc036a11e11aae21c8183de",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/listening-05.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/listening-05.wav",
      "script": "いどうのほうほうです。いちばん。ばすでいきます。にばん。くるまでいきます。さんばん。でんしゃでいきます。よんばん。じてんしゃでいきます。",
      "sha256": "dc06037a51e2e5ad9b15efccade47f8cfbc96eac4a78b2d634d786abdc49364f",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/listening-06.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/listening-06.wav",
      "script": "だれといきますか。",
      "sha256": "39986e3804cdb9d4399672e5655669907b686366a9fd819910ccfbc616a8411c",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-words-1.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-words-1.wav",
      "script": "いく。くる。かえる。あるいて。のる。",
      "sha256": "fc3f1bf908dbed6d76356fb95d4a0142e557b6629d898a3ee4d5a8ba8b35c717",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-words-2.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-words-2.wav",
      "script": "おりる。でんしゃ。バス。じてんしゃ。くるま。",
      "sha256": "61f148c6e789b444adeb82e94980095b65ce5b52fa96fbd1231a3e4619b08f42",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-words-3.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-words-3.wav",
      "script": "タクシー。ひこうき。ふね。ちかてつ。きっぷ。",
      "sha256": "6941c0f4559d4c9c43babae1b38bfd5d1e91fbe52872aef878c4206d673b5ea3",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-words-4.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-words-4.wav",
      "script": "びょういん。ぎんこう。ゆうびんきょく。としょかん。くうこう。",
      "sha256": "25e1e2fad40348ff67277bbb8a84ce8dbdc96dc8855244e282d933409a759c9a",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-words-5.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-words-5.wav",
      "script": "バスてい。いりぐち。でぐち。いっしょに。だれと。",
      "sha256": "665f4e99fcd0930de9213a358fb5ccb98dd7ca5a55b576a817c20be9179110a6",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-kanji.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-kanji.wav",
      "script": "いきます。きます。くるま。いりぐち。でぐち。いりぐちははいるところ、でぐちはでるところです。",
      "sha256": "1c5e504923cf1fe1ea6caa5abab7fc9fa8929020342956a89b2aff05b7acb712",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-G22.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-G22.wav",
      "script": "えきへいきます。えきにいきます。どこへいきますか。としょかんへいきます。",
      "sha256": "3c16a70c6ec551f616c675b7f0653a29f12be0a565f66a128a3895e10dd5974e",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-G23.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-G23.wav",
      "script": "がっこうへばすでいきます。としょかんへでんしゃでいきます。えきへあるいていきます。なにでいきますか。ばすでいきます。",
      "sha256": "0639fa626ff8907b3cc8857b1ec2767ce9d7ce892273158b37adf4d3bf3a5b80",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-G24.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-G24.wav",
      "script": "あねといきます。ともだちとがっこうへいきます。だれといきますか。ともだちといきます。ひとりでいきます。",
      "sha256": "1ccafe071aa6e97ecc5dacd21b8e1dd04501086530de37dca797356dd0ab8d1f",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-context.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u08/U08-teach-context.wav",
      "script": "あねと、としょかんへ、ばすでいきます。だれと、どこへ、なにでいくかをたしかめましょう。",
      "sha256": "8c74effd3e62f4c5ccd0b908fdd0eef8ab0d28bb0b1b62be609bc8cf24f7e8f1",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
